.claude/worktrees/

# Crawled DNB fixture, restored into every worktree by ops/setup-worktree.sh as
# a symlink into the main clone. `.venv` is ignored for exactly this reason
# (that script's own comment: "so the symlink never shows in status") but this
# path was missed, so a routine `git add -A` in a worktree committed an
# ABSOLUTE symlink to one machine's checkout -- dangling anywhere else.
data/dnbeiendom/html_crawled